BEHAVIOR to-lower

DESCRIPTION
  Copies the null-terminated src into dst, converting ASCII A-Z to a-z.
  dst is null-terminated; length is the byte count (excluding the terminator).

CONTRACT
  INPUT src bytes 65536
  OUTPUT dst bytes 65536
  OUTPUT length int 8
  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH 7b782d38

IMPLEMENTATION
  STORE dst 0 1 0
  i = 0

  LABEL loop
    c = LOAD src 1 i
    cz = IEQ c 0 1
    BRANCH cz fin body

  LABEL body
    cu = AND c 255 8
    ge = IGE cu 65 8
    le = ILE cu 90 8
    is_upper = AND ge le 8
    BRANCH is_upper lower keep

  LABEL lower
    lo = IADD cu 32 8
    STORE dst lo 1 i
    JUMP adv

  LABEL keep
    STORE dst cu 1 i

  LABEL adv
    i = IADD i 1 8
    JUMP loop

  LABEL fin
    STORE dst 0 1 i
    STORE length i 8
END
